# SAMD51 boot/connect smoke test. The local samd51p20.repl plus the
# OSCCTRL/GCLK/OSC32KCTRL synthesis stubs (samd_oscctrl_stub.py,
# samd_gclk_stub.py, samd_osc32kctrl_stub.py) plus the MCLK/CMCC
# storeback regions are runtime-injected by renode_launcher.py
# (_EXTRA_PERIPHERAL_STUBS_FOR_CHIP['samd51p20']); without these the
# firmware spins forever in samd51_clock.c. There is no SAMD51-based
# printer config in config/, so this is the only place SAMD51P20 is
# wired through the test runner today.
DICTIONARY samd51p20.dict
CONFIG samd51_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR samd51_smoke.fixture.json

# A few harmless gcode lines so klippy gets past klippy:ready.
M114
M105
M105
M105

# klippy connected and stayed connected long enough to do the
# clocksync handshake against the firmware's generic/armcm_timer view.
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
